  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'this is what happens when you don't spank your kids.' The use of 'you' and 'your kids' directly addresses the viewer, implying that the consequences depicted (the overturned car) are a result of the viewer's parenting choices. This creates a direct address to the user, making them the subject of the implied causal relationship.",
